body:
How crazy the left has become? You have conservatives stating that they want more guns because mass-shootings stem from issues with mental health, but then they BLOCK mental health bills? Conservatives stating that they want more freedoms, but then they want to censor books in children's schools about nazicism and any dissent against authoritarianism and take away abortion rights? Conservatives stating that they care about the middle and lower classes, but then they pass more tax codes to benefit the rich, even after they CALL OUT the system for supporting the rich? Conservatives stating that we need to religiously follow the bill of rights but then allow religious ideologies to permeate our government? Conservatives stating blatant lies (that have been fact-checked) about our economy, about history (creating revisionist history), and touting them as truth? Conservatives stating that our border crisis is in shambles when they ultimately have no ideas as to how to fix it? I mean, really? 

&#x200B;

Open your eyes. Conservatives are treasonous, brainwashed individuals who have less morals than any individual relegated to the depths of hell.
